{"seq":1,"slug":"context-scaling-economics","title":"上下文规模扩张的经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/context-scaling-economics","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文规模扩张的经济学\">上下文规模扩张的经济学</h1><p>把整本三百页的合同塞进一次 API 调用，2026 年第一次成了财务上「可能犯但未必该犯」的错误。一年前这要么塞不下，要么贵到没人敢报销；如今十三个以上模型提供 100 万 token 以上的窗口（Claude Fable 5、Opus 4.8、GPT-5.5、Gemini 3.1 Pro、DeepSeek V4、MiniMax M3、Qwen3.5-Plus 等，据 <a href=\"https://www.morphllm.com/llm-context-window-comparison\">Morph LLM Context Window Comparison 2026</a>），价格还在一年内集体跳水约 80%。但「能装下」不等于「装下划算」——上下文规模的经济学，本质是一道在 token 单价、注意力的平方级算力、KV 缓存的线性显存、缓存折扣、以及任务准确率之间求最优的成本函数。这篇文档讲清这条成本曲线长什么样，以及商业产品该在曲线哪一段定价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从单价到全窗口成本\">核心概念：从单价到全窗口成本</h2><p>定价表上的「每百万 token 多少钱」具有极强的误导性，因为它把一个平方级的物理成本伪装成线性账单。真正决定钱包的，是「把窗口填到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 时，每生成一步要重新关注的全部上下文」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[上下文规模 n token] --&gt; B[预填充 prefill&lt;br/&gt;注意力算力 ~ O of n squared]&#10;  A --&gt; C[KV 缓存显存&lt;br/&gt;~ O of n 线性增长]&#10;  B --&gt; D[首 token 延迟 TTFT 升高]&#10;  C --&gt; E[单卡可并发 batch 下降]&#10;  D --&gt; F[单位 token 真实成本上升]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{缓存命中?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[缓存读 0.1x 单价&lt;br/&gt;成本骤降]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[按全价计费&lt;br/&gt;长窗口惩罚生效]\">flowchart TD\n  A[上下文规模 n token] --&gt; B[预填充 prefill&lt;br/&gt;注意力算力 ~ O of n squared]\n  A --&gt; C[KV 缓存显存&lt;br/&gt;~ O of n 线性增长]\n  B --&gt; D[首 token 延迟 TTFT 升高]\n  C --&gt; E[单卡可并发 batch 下降]\n  D --&gt; F[单位 token 真实成本上升]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{缓存命中?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[缓存读 0.1x 单价&lt;br/&gt;成本骤降]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[按全价计费&lt;br/&gt;长窗口惩罚生效]</pre><p>自注意力的计算量随序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 平方增长，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；而生成 1000 个新 token 时，注意力要被「从头算」近一千次，于是长序列上的累计成本进一步放大（<a href=\"https://www.digitalocean.com/community/conceptual-articles/how-kv-caching-slashes-llm-inference-costs-at-scale\">DigitalOcean: KV Caching</a>）。KV 缓存把已算过的键值对存下来避免重算，把每步的注意力摊薄到接近线性，但代价是显存随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 和 batch 大小线性膨胀，很快把 H100、H200 这样的高显存卡占满。换句话说：平方级的是算力，线性级的是显存，两者共同抬高长窗口下每个 token 的「真实成本」，而账单上的单价只是把这层物理现实平均化后的结果。</p>\n<p>下表用 2026 年 6 月 9 日的公开报价（<a href=\"https://www.morphllm.com/llm-api\">Morph LLM API 2026</a>、<a href=\"https://benchlm.ai/llm-pricing\">BenchLM.ai Pricing 2026</a>）展示同一件事——「填满 100 万 token 窗口」在不同模型上的成本跨度高达 71 倍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>输入单价（/1M token）</th>\n<th>输出单价（/1M token）</th>\n<th>填满 1M 窗口的输入成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DeepSeek V4 Flash</td>\n<td>$0.14</td>\n<td>$0.28</td>\n<td>$0.14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite</td>\n<td>$0.10</td>\n<td>$0.40</td>\n<td>$0.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gemini 3.1 Pro（≤200K）</td>\n<td>$2.00</td>\n<td>$12.00</td>\n<td>$2.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Opus 4.8</td>\n<td>$5.00</td>\n<td>$25.00</td>\n<td>$5.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-5.5</td>\n<td>$5.00</td>\n<td>$30.00</td>\n<td>$5.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Fable 5</td>\n<td>$10.00</td>\n<td>$50.00</td>\n<td>$10.00</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"平方级成本如何转成阶梯定价\">平方级成本如何转成阶梯定价</h2><p>厂商不可能把平方级曲线原样写进价目表——客户读不懂，也无法做预算。于是 2026 年出现了两种把曲线「离散化」的定价工程。</p>\n<p>第一种是 Gemini 的<strong>阶梯单价</strong>。Gemini 3.1 Pro 在 200K token 以内按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>输入</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 输入 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span></span></span></span></span>12 输出计费，一旦提示词越过 200K，整笔请求跳到更贵的「长上下文档位」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>输入</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 输入 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输入</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span></span></span></span></span>18 输出（<a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/gemini-pricing-in-2026\">Finout: Gemini Pricing 2026</a>）。这条 200K 的硬阈值直接对应着平方级成本在某个长度后变得不可忽略的拐点——厂商用一道台阶把曲线近似成两段常数，既能覆盖长窗口的边际算力，又让客户能用「多少 token」一刀切地估算账单。</p>\n<p>第二种是 Anthropic 的<strong>平价长上下文</strong>。Claude 把 100 万 token 窗口做成「第 100 个 token 和第 90 万个 token 同价」，全程不设阶梯（<a href=\"https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/flat-rate-long-context-pricing-anthropic-claude\">MindStudio: Flat-Rate Long-Context</a>）。这是一种典型的「把复杂度内部消化」的产品决策：厂商自己吃下平方级的边际成本，换取客户在架构上敢于「整本塞进去」，从而把更多工作负载吸到自家平台。两种策略对应两种商业意图——Gemini 让重度长文用户为长度多付钱，Claude 用确定性单价降低客户的决策摩擦。</p>\n<p>设单次请求上下文为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> token、阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、低档单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、高档单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则阶梯定价下的输入成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\begin{cases} p_1 \\cdot L &amp; L \\le T \\\\ p_2 \\cdot L &amp; L &gt; T \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而平价定价恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = p \\cdot L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 附近反复横跳时，阶梯定价会带来账单的不连续抖动——这正是把请求裁剪到刚好 200K 以内成为一种工程优化手段的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存-把长上下文成本打到一折\">缓存：把长上下文成本打到一折</h2><p>如果上下文里有大块内容在多次请求间不变——系统提示词、知识库、整份代码仓、那本三百页合同——那么为它反复付全价就是纯浪费。2026 年三家主流厂商都用「缓存」把这块成本打到约一折。</p>\n<p>Anthropic 的提示缓存让缓存读只收 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> 倍输入单价（九折优惠），代价是首次写入要付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（5 分钟缓存）或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（1 小时缓存）的写入费；5 分钟缓存只需命中一次即回本，1 小时缓存命中两次回本（<a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\">Finout: Anthropic API Pricing 2026</a>）。Gemini 的上下文缓存同样把重复部分降约九成——Gemini 3.1 Pro 的缓存读从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.00</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span></span></span></span></span> 每百万 token（<a href=\"https://techjacksolutions.com/ai-tools/google-gemini/gemini-context-caching-cost-optimization/\">Tech Jacks: Gemini Context Caching 2026</a>）。对 RAG、代码助手这类高度重复上下文的应用，缓存通常把整体成本压低 88%–95%（<a href=\"https://aicostcheck.com/blog/ai-prompt-caching-cost-savings\">AI Cost Check: Prompt Caching Savings 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>缓存的回本逻辑可以写成一个简单的盈亏平衡条件。设静态前缀为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> token，写入溢价系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>（如 1.25），缓存读折扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（如 0.1），后续命中次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，则相对不缓存的节省为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Saving</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Saving} = p \\cdot S \\cdot \\big[k - w - r \\cdot k\\big] = p \\cdot S \\cdot \\big[k(1-r) - w\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Saving</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k(1-r) &gt; w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 时缓存划算。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span></span></span></span></span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.39</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k &gt; 1.39</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.39</span></span></span></span></span>，即第二次命中后必然盈利——这解释了为什么任何「同一份大文档被多轮追问」的产品都该默认开缓存。下表对比三种成本优化手段的叠加关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>折扣量级</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>可叠加</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提示/上下文缓存</td>\n<td>约 90%（读 0.1x）</td>\n<td>大块前缀重复出现</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批处理 Batch API</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>容忍异步、非实时</td>\n<td>与缓存可叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存 + 批处理叠加</td>\n<td>95%+</td>\n<td>离线 + 重复上下文</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>批处理对所有模型再砍 50%，且与缓存折扣可叠加，组合后整体可省 95% 以上（<a href=\"https://pecollective.com/tools/claude-pricing-guide/\">PE Collective: Claude Cost Optimization 2026</a>）。这意味着「长上下文很贵」在 2026 年已经是一个需要限定前提的命题——只在「实时 + 上下文每次都变」的场景才真正昂贵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长上下文-vs-检索-成本不是唯一的轴\">长上下文 vs 检索：成本不是唯一的轴</h2><p>既然能整本塞进去，是不是就该废掉 RAG？2026 年的答案是「不」，而且理由首先是成本，其次才是准确率。</p>\n<p>成本上的对比很直白：用 2026 年 4 月报价做的一项测算里，长上下文方案要把整份 50 万 token 语料塞进提示词，而检索方案只返回约 4000 token 的相关片段——但研究显示，长上下文与 RAG 的预测结果在超过 60% 的查询上完全一致（<a href=\"https://medium.com/@9-5-datascientist/rag-vs-long-context-windows-in-2026-when-should-you-use-which-d0ab5fcb6efd\">Medium: RAG vs Long Context 2026</a>）。也就是说，对这六成查询，多付的那 124 倍 token 成本买不到任何额外正确性。准确率上也有隐忧：NVIDIA RULER 基准显示，多跳和聚合类任务的准确率会在 32K 到 128K token 之间显著下滑，模型不同拐点不同——窗口装得下，不代表模型读得准。</p>\n<p>延迟则是另一条独立的成本轴：优化良好的 RAG 管线端到端约 1 秒，而把 100 万 token 整体送进长上下文配置往往要 30–60 秒（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/long-context-vs-rag-1m-token-windows/\">SitePoint: Long Context vs RAG</a>）。对要求 2 秒内响应的交互式产品，长上下文几乎自动出局。此外，RAG 天然支持按用户权限过滤检索结果（多租户访问控制）、以及监管要求的「哪些文档支撑了这个答案」审计链——这些是把整本塞进黑箱窗口给不了的。</p>\n<p>2026 年的主流结论因此是混合架构：<strong>用检索决定证据集该包含什么，用长上下文在这个有界证据集上做深度推理</strong>（<a href=\"https://redis.io/blog/rag-vs-large-context-window-ai-apps/\">Redis: RAG vs Large Context Window</a>）。先建检索层，再用长窗口在召回的文档上推理——这既压住了 token 账单，又保住了延迟、权限与可审计性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>上下文成本的物理底座是「平方级算力 + 线性显存」：注意力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定算力，KV 缓存随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 线性吃显存，账单单价只是把这层现实平均化的产物。</li>\n<li>同样「填满 100 万 token」，DeepSeek V4 Flash 与 Claude Fable 5 之间存在 71 倍成本差，全行业一年降价约 80%——选型对长文成本的影响远大于任何代码优化。</li>\n<li>厂商用两种定价工程把平方级曲线离散化：Gemini 的 200K 阶梯单价（越界跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/</span></span></span></span></span>18），Anthropic 的全程平价长上下文，背后是「让重度用户多付」与「降低客户决策摩擦」两种商业意图。</li>\n<li>缓存是长上下文的成本杀手：读取约一折，第二次命中即回本（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.39</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&gt;1.39</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.39</span></span></span></span></span>），叠加批处理可省 95% 以上；「长上下文很贵」只在实时且上下文每次都变时才成立。</li>\n<li>长上下文不废 RAG：超 60% 查询两者结果一致、长窗口准确率在 32K–128K 间下滑、延迟相差几十秒，外加权限与审计需求——2026 主流是「检索选证据、长窗口做推理」的混合架构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"上下文规模扩张的经济学","id":"上下文规模扩张的经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从单价到全窗口成本","id":"核心概念-从单价到全窗口成本"},{"level":2,"text":"平方级成本如何转成阶梯定价","id":"平方级成本如何转成阶梯定价"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存：把长上下文成本打到一折","id":"缓存-把长上下文成本打到一折"},{"level":2,"text":"长上下文 vs 检索：成本不是唯一的轴","id":"长上下文-vs-检索-成本不是唯一的轴"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提示词缓存与批处理的成本杠杆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/token-pricing-and-inference-economics/prompt-caching-and-batching"},"next":{"title":"取舍之争：RAG 与长上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/rag-vs-long-context-tradeoff"}}